\par }{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4002026\charrsid4002026 
A quasi-experimental design is one that follows the general procedures of experimental research,without the use of control group or without random assignment, since random assignment or the use of control groups is often not fea
sible in educational settings.}{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid4002026 
\par }{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4002026\charrsid4002026 
