\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 Write a note on thinking stage in a research.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4981956 {\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Be inclusive with your thinking.
\par }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Don't try to eliminate ideas too quickly.
\par Build on your ideas and see how many different research projects you can identify.
\par Try and be creative.
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Write down your ideas.
\par }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 This will allow you to revisit an idea later on.
\par Or, you can modify and change an idea.
\par write your ideas they tend to be in a continual state of change
\par Good feeling to sit down and scan the many ideas
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Try not to be overly influenced at this time by what you feel others expect from you }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 (your
\par colleagues, your profession, your academic department, etc.).
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 You have a much better chance of selecting a topic that will be really of interest to you if it is your
\par topic. .
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Don't begin your thinking by assuming that your research will draw international attention to you!!
\par }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Instead, be realistic in setting your goal.
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Make sure your expectations are tempered by:
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4929842 T}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 he realization that you are fulfilling an academic requirement,
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Be realistic about the time that you're willing to commit to your research project. }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 If it's a 10 year
\par project that you're thinking about admit it
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Create a draft of a timeline. the next item)
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 put a start and a finish time for each.
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Post your timeline in a conspicuous place (above your computer monitor?) so that it continually
\par reminds you how you're doing.
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Periodically update your timeline with new dates as needed.
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 If you're going to ask for a leave of absence from your job while you're working on your research
\par this isn't a good time to do it. Chances are you can do the "thinking about it" stage without a leave of
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4981956 {\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 absence.}{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977     }{\b\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 
