\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 What are the qualities of a good market report?              }{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2702977 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977     }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Qualities Of A Good Market Report
\par }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 A person writing a M}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 arket Report should have a comprehensive knowledge of the matter that has
\par to be reported. He must always keep in mind the following points.
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 1. }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Normally a Market Report is not personal. It should be written using third person and the past
\par tense.
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 2. }{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 It should be easy so that }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 general readers can }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 
 understand the technical terms used in the report.}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 3}{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 . }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 There should be a good analysis of changes of prices and demand and supply relationship.}{
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 4}{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 . }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Words should be used economically. Unnecessary details must be avoided. It should not be so
\par short that misses the essential information.
\par }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 5. }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Market Report should be based upon the facts. Events should be wri}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 tten in the minute details. Any }{
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 writer of Market Report should be unbiased while concluding his report.}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid2702977 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid2701426 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par }{\b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 Question No: 27    ( Marks: 5 ) 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2701426 {\b\cf0\ulc0\insrsid3876372 {\pict{\*\picprop\shplid1051{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 75}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLine}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}
