\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 What are the advantages of \lquote electronic media\rquote  in the new business world and how does it help in effective communication?
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\cf0\ulc0\insrsid3895221 Ans:}{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 
\par }{\cf0\ulc0\insrsid3895221 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3895221 {\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893 Advantage of electronic Media
\par }{\f38\fs22\cf2\lang9\langfe1033\langnp9\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid1319977 Communicating is a key requirement for any successful business and everyone trying to develop
 a striving career. But communication is not as simple as speaking a few words. In business, you need to consider carefully how to communicate to your target audience.}{\f38\fs22\cf2\lang9\langfe1033\langnp9\ulc0\insrsid1319977 
\par }{\f38\fs22\cf2\lang9\langfe1033\langnp9\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid1319977 electronic media such as email into this category. The key advantage of written communic
ation is that you have a written record of what was communicated, when and to whom. It does not leave any doubt about what was agreed and therefore forms the basis of organizational communication.}{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893 \line 
                                    }{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893 Electronic media (or st
orage devices) are of different types based on technique used for storing information. e.g. Flash memory based, Optical Storage (DVD, CD) or more traditional magnetic storage devices (floppy discs/storage tapes/hard disks)}{
\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893 
\par                                    }{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893 T}{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893 here is many ways of electronic}{\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893  communication but e}{
\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893 mail}{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893 offers speed, low cost, increased access to other employees, portability, and convenience}{
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893 (not just overcoming time-zone problems but carryin}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893 g a message to many receivers in}{
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893  one}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid10485893\charrsid10485893  time}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid10485893 ). It\rquote s best fo
r communicating brief, noncomplex information that is time sensitive, but its effectiveness depends on user skill. Because the turnaround time can be quite fast, email tends to be more conversational than traditional paper-based media.
