\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1319977 Describe the various personal styles in negotiation.  }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1903681 
\par Ans:
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1903681 {\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Personal Styles in Negotiation
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Whenever people come together to negotiate, they bring their own personal styles, and these affect
\par the way they communicate and handle the conflict.
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Self-denying;
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 people difficult to negotiate,}{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 
are introverted and reticent with information(feedback),hide their their feelings
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Self-protecting}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 :
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 People use divisionary tactics,discussing other people or side tracking to other issues hide their true
\par feelings
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Self-exposing}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 :,
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 People wish to be centre of attention, demand this attention by speaking loudly,speak over other
\par use attention-seeking body movement or by ignoring feedback and other\rquote s view
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Self-bargaining}{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 :
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 People show feeling if you show yours.wait until you lead them in negotiation open up when others
\par initiate the process
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 Self-actualizing:
\par }{\f42\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 \bullet  }{\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 People ideal negotiators , want information and feedback from others, present information
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1903681 {\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 constructively to aid the negotiation process, achieve goal without conflict(}{\b\f38\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1903681\charrsid13990043 
berriers)}{\f1\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid13990043                                                           }{\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid13990043 
\par }}